#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Sawirada wajigaaga oo Ubuntu Hello la barbar dhigo. Hayso ugu yaraan laba, "
"ku duub nal kala duwan."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Tusaya moodooyinka la kaydiyay ee:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Hal qaab weji oo keliya ayaa diiwaangashan. Muraayadaha indhaha, isbeddelka "
"gadhka ama iftiin kala duwan waxay beddelaan sida kamaraddu u aragto "
"wejigaaga, sidaas darteed hal qaab ayaa fashilmi kara (tusaale ahaan fiidkii "
"nalalka hoostooda). Ku dar qaab labaad adigoo xidhan ama aan xidhnayn "
"muraayadaha, muuqaalkaaga kale, ama iftiin kale si furitaanku uu u ahaado "
"mid lagu kalsoonaan karo."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Ku dar nooc labaad"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Qaababka"

#: src/main.ui:261
