#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Ogeysiisyada"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Ogeysiinta desktop-ka waxay muujineysaa marka Ubuntu Hello ay raadineyso "
"wejigaaga, ka dibna ka warbixiso natiijada. Isku day guuldarraystay ayaa ku "
"jiraya liiska wargelinta"

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Muuji ogeysiisyada"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Hal kaar isku day xaqiijinta waji kasta, oo la cusboonaysiiyay natiijada."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Ogeysiinta dhawaaqa"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Daar codka nidaamka isku day la aqoonsan yahay ama fashilmay."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Ku dar baaritaannada"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ku dar moodka, hubaal vs. marinka, fareemada, kamarada iyo wakhtiga kaadh "
"kasta. Faa'iido leh marka dhib la soo sheegayo."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Ammaanka"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Sida ay u dhow tahay inuu wajigaagu is barbar dhigo, iyo in Ubuntu Hello kaa "
"codsado inaad xaqiijiso inaad dhab ahaan joogto."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Adkaanta isbarbardhigga wajiga"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Degdeg ah"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Isku dheeli tiran"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "Ammaan"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "I weydii inaan madaxa ruxo si aan u xaqiijiyo"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Marka wajigaaga la aqoonsado, ogeysiis ayaa kaa codsanaya inaad madaxa hoos-"
"hoos u ruxdo. Sawir kamaradda horteeda la taagay madax ma ruxi karo."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Furaha / KWallet Si toos ah u fur"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Shid aqoonsiga wejiga si keyring-kaaga gelitaanka ama KWallet si toos ah "
"loogu furo markaad gasho. Tani waxay si ammaan ah u kaydisaa eraygaaga sirta "
"ah, oo ku shaabadaysan TPM marka la heli karo, ama lagu sireeyay AES-256-GCM "
"iyadoo la isticmaalayo fure weyn oo root keliya isticmaali karo. Aqoonsiga "
"wejigu wuxuu dejiyaa PAM_AUTHTOK ee pam_gnome_keyring ama pam_kwallet5, "
"taasoo ku xidhan desktop-kaaga."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Xaalada Hadda:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Hubinta..."

