msgstr "Ku saabsan"

#: src/onboarding.ui:9 src/onboarding.ui:14
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello"
msgstr "Ku soo dhawoow Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.ui:52
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Dejinta waa la sameeyay!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:68
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing anything "
"you would normally have to type your password for to authenticate, like "
"running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unlock, your login "
"keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically on login.\n"
"\n"
"You can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to change more advanced "
"settings or add additional models. Press Finish below to close this window "
"and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Waanu dhammaynay! Ubuntu Hello hadda wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa kumbuyuutarkan. Isku "
"day inaad sameyso wax kasta oo aad caadiyan ku qasban tahay inaad ku qorto "
"eraygaaga sirta ah si loo xaqiijiyo, sida ku socodsiinta amarka sudo. Haddii "
"aad karti u siiso furaha otomaatiga ah, furahaaga soo gelida ama KWallet "
"sidoo kale si toos ah ayaa loo furayaa marka la soo galo.\n"
"\n"
"Waxaad furi kartaa Ubuntu Hello Configurator ka dib si aad u bedesho goobo "
"horumarsan oo dheeraad ah. Riix Finish hoos si aad u xirto daaqadan oo aad u "
"furto Ubuntu Hello Configurator."

#: src/onboarding.ui:105
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Dejinta siyaasad hubaal ah"

#: src/onboarding.ui:121
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match is "
"never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you can set "
"how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Isbadalada xagasha, fogaanta, iyo arimaha kale dartood isbarbardhiga weji "
"marnaba lama mid aha qaabka wajiga kaydsan. Boggaan waxaad dejin kartaa sida "
"adag ee Ubuntu Hello ay tahay."

#: src/onboarding.ui:160
msgid ""
"The most forgiving match and the quickest to let you in. Choose this if "
"convenience matters more than strictness."
msgstr ""
"Isbarbardhigga ugu deeqsiga badan iyo kan ugu dhaqsaha badan ee ku galinaya. "
"Kan dooro haddii fudeydku kaaga muhiimsan yahay adkaanta."

#: src/onboarding.ui:191
msgid ""
"A strict match that still logs you in quickly. It may not recognise you at a "
"sharp angle or from further away."
msgstr ""
"Isbarbardhig adag oo weli si degdeg ah kuu galinaya. Waxaa laga yaabaa "
"inuusan ku aqoonsan marka aad xagal weyn u jeeddo ama aad ka fog tahay "
"kamaradda."

#: src/onboarding.ui:223
msgid "The strictest match, with no extra step when you log in. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"Isbarbardhigga ugu adag, iyadoo aan tallaabo dheeraad ah lagaa rabin markaad "
"gasho. Waa lagu talinayaa."

#: src/onboarding.ui:379
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Ka bood hadda"

#: src/onboarding.ui:384
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-hello "
"add"
msgstr ""
"Waxaad ku dari kartaa noocyo badan oo waji ah hadhow Settings ama waxaad ku "
"dari kartaa: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.ui:403 src/onboarding.ui:531
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Dejinta kamaradaha webka"

#: src/onboarding.ui:435
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Emitter-ka infraredku miyuu biliglaynayaa?"

#: src/onboarding.ui:447
msgid ""
"Look at the camera you selected: an infrared camera shows a small light that "
"blinks while Ubuntu Hello tests it. This tells us whether it can see your "
"face in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Fiiri kamarada aad dooratay: kamarad infrared ayaa muujinaysa iftiin yar oo "
"biligleynaya halka Ubuntu Hello tijaabinayso. Tani waxay noo sheegaysaa inay "
"arki karto wejigaaga gudcurka iyo in kale."

#: src/onboarding.ui:481
msgid "Yes, it flashes"
msgstr "Haa, way iftiimaysaa"

#: src/onboarding.ui:507
msgid "No, nothing flashes"
msgstr "Maya, ma jiraan wax iftiimaya"

#: src/onboarding.ui:547
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available "
"cameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list of "
"usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and click Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah uga baadhi doontaa nidaamkaaga kamarado kasta "
"oo la heli karo, markaa hubi in kamaraddaada shabakadu ku xidhan tahay. Ka "
"dib markii la ogaado liiska kamaradaha webka ee la isticmaali karo ayaa la "
"tusi doonaa. Dooro midka aad rabto inaad isticmaasho oo guji Next."

#: src/onboarding.ui:566
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Tijaabi kamaradahaaga mareegaha, fadlan sug..."

#: src/onboarding.ui:613
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Soo dejinta xogta faylasha"

#: src/onboarding.ui:629
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be able "
"to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the download "
"progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay u baahan tahay saddex kayd oo hore u tababaran oo "
"aqoonsiga wajiga ah si ay awood ugu yeelato inay ku aqoonsato, kuwaas oo "
"hadda la soo dejin doono. Hoos waxaad ka arki kartaa horumarka download."

#: src/onboarding.ui:653
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Bilaabida soo dejinta"

#: src/onboarding.ui:697
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Ku soo dhawoow Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.ui:709
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Nooca"

#: src/onboarding.ui:723
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Saaxirkan ayaa kugu socon doona habka dejinta oo si toos ah ayuu kuugu "
"habeyn doonaa Ubuntu Hello. Riix ku xiga si aad u sii wado"

#: src/onboarding.ui:775
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet using "
"face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa furahaaga galida ama KWallet "
"adoo isticmaalaya aqoonsiga wejiga, ka hortagga furaha sirta ah ka dib "
"markaad gasho."

#: src/onboarding.ui:787
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Daar fur furidda tooska ah/KWallet"

#: src/onboarding.ui:815
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Xaqiiji erayga sirta ah"

#: src/onboarding.ui:872
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Dib u noqo"

#: src/onboarding.ui:907
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "dhame habaynta"

#: src/onboarding.ui:934
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Xiga"

